  "content": "<p>RTX Corporation, formerly Raytheon Technologies, is a leading aerospace and defense company that provides advanced systems and services for commercial, military, and government customers worldwide. The company operates through three industry-leading businesses: Collins Aerospace, Pratt &amp; Whitney, and Raytheon. Its portfolio includes aircraft engines, avionics, aerostructures, cybersecurity, missiles, air defense systems, and precision weapons. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, RTX is dedicated to pushing the boundaries of technology and science to solve the world's most complex challenges in flight and defense.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20T.%20Calio\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher T. Calio</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Christopher T. Calio is President and Chief Executive Officer of RTX. He was appointed CEO in May 2024 and has been President since March 2023. Previously, he served as Chief Operating Officer and President of Pratt & Whitney.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Pankaj%20Srivastava\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Pankaj Srivastava</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Pankaj Srivastava is the Chief Financial Officer of RTX, appointed in April 2024. He previously served as Senior Vice President, Finance and Corporate Strategy.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Shane%20G.%20Eddy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Shane G. Eddy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2022 March)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Pratt & Whitney</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Shane G. Eddy is President of Pratt & Whitney. He joined Pratt & Whitney in 2016 and has held various leadership roles in operations and supply chain.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Phil%20Jasper\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Phil Jasper</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 January)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Raytheon</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Phil Jasper is President of Raytheon. He previously served as President of Mission Systems at Collins Aerospace.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Stephen%20J.%20Timm\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Stephen J. Timm</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 February)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Collins Aerospace</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Stephen J. Timm is President of Collins Aerospace. He has been with the company and its predecessors for over 20 years.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Raja%20Maharajh\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Raja Maharajh</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2022 December)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Legal Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Raja Maharajh is Chief Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary of RTX.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20J.%20Hayes\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory J. Hayes</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Gregory J. Hayes is the Executive Chairman of the Board of RTX. He served as CEO from 2020 to 2024 and previously as Chairman and CEO of United Technologies Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Christopher%20T.%20Calio\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Christopher T. Calio</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2024 May)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of RTX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tracy%20A.%20Atkinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tracy A. Atkinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President of State Street Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Bernard%20A.%20Harris%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Bernard A. Harris, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chief Executive Officer and Managing Partner of Vesalius Ventures, Inc. and former NASA astronaut.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20R.%20Oliver\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George R. Oliver</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman and CEO of Johnson Controls International plc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20K.%20Ortberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert K. Ortberg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of Rockwell Collins and former Special Advisor to the Office of the CEO of RTX.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Margaret%20L.%20O'Sullivan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Margaret L. O'Sullivan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jeane Kirkpatrick Professor of the Practice of International Affairs at Harvard University's Kennedy School.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dinesh%20C.%20Paliwal\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dinesh C. Paliwal</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Partner at KKR & Co. Inc. and former Chairman and CEO of HARMAN International.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20A.%20Winnefeld%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James A. Winnefeld, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired U.S. Navy Admiral and former Vice Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20O.%20Work\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert O. Work</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(Date: 2020 April)</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former U.S. Deputy Secretary of Defense.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/101829/000010182924000011/rtx-20240325.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">RTX Corporation 2024 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-25)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/101829/000010182924000007/rtx-20231231.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">RTX Corporation Annual Report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-02-05)</span></li></ul>"
    }
